    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<p><a href="/zh-tw/product-category/sesame-series/">黑芝麻</a> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_0" data-source="" data-orig="oil is extracted from black sesame seeds">oil is extracted from black sesame seeds</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_1" data-source="" data-orig="also known as sesame or fragrant oil">also known as sesame or fragrant oil</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_2" data-source="" data-orig="Pure black sesame oil has an amber color and is crystal clear">Pure black sesame oil has an amber color and is crystal clear</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_3" data-source="" data-orig="Let&#8217;s dive into an introduction to black sesame oil">Let&#8217;s dive into an introduction to black sesame oil</span>.</p><div id="ez-toc-container" class="ez-toc-v2_0_85 counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-grey ez-toc-container-direction"><div class="ez-toc-title-container"><p class="ez-toc-title" style="cursor:inherit">目錄</p>
<span class="ez-toc-title-toggle"><a href="#" class="ez-toc-pull-right ez-toc-btn ez-toc-btn-xs ez-toc-btn-default ez-toc-toggle" aria-label="Toggle Table of Content"><span class="ez-toc-js-icon-con"><span class=""><span class="eztoc-hide" style="display:none;">切換</span><span class="ez-toc-icon-toggle-span"><svg style="fill: #999;color:#999" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="list-377408" width="20px" height="20px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6 6H4v2h2V6zm14 0H8v2h12V6zM4 11h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2zM4 16h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg style="fill: #999;color:#999" class="arrow-unsorted-368013" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10px" height="10px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.2" baseProfile="tiny"><path d="M18.2 9.3l-6.2-6.3-6.2 6.3c-.2.2-.3.4-.3.7s.1.5.3.7c.2.2.4.3.7.3h11c.3 0 .5-.1.7-.3.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7zM5.8 14.7l6.2 6.3 6.2-6.3c.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7c-.2-.2-.4-.3-.7-.3h-11c-.3 0-.5.1-.7.3-.2.2-.3.5-.3.7s.1.5.3.7z"/></svg></span></span></span></a></span></div><nav><ul class='ez-toc-list ez-toc-list-level-1 ' ><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-1" href="#How_is_Black_Sesame_Oil_Made" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_4" data-source="" data-orig="How is Black Sesame Oil Made">How is Black Sesame Oil Made</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-2" href="#How_to_Use_Black_Sesame_Oil" >如何使用黑芝麻油?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-3" href="#What_Are_the_Other_Uses_of_Black_Sesame_Oil" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_5" data-source="" data-orig="What Are the Other Uses of Black Sesame Oil">What Are the Other Uses of Black Sesame Oil</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4" href="#Has_Black_Sesame_Oil_Replaced_the_Common_Oils_on_the_Market" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_6" data-source="" data-orig="Has Black Sesame Oil Replaced the Common Oils on the Market">Has Black Sesame Oil Replaced the Common Oils on the Market</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5" href="#Will_Black_Sesame_Oil_Make_Your_Hair_Darker" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_7" data-source="" data-orig="Will Black Sesame Oil Make Your Hair Darker">Will Black Sesame Oil Make Your Hair Darker</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6" href="#How_Much_Does_Black_Sesame_Oil_Cost" >黑芝麻油多少錢?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7" href="#Which_is_Better_Black_Sesame_Oil_or_White_Sesame_Oil" >哪個更好: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_8" data-source="" data-orig="Black Sesame Oil or White Sesame Oil">Black Sesame Oil or White Sesame Oil</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8" href="#Is_Black_Sesame_Oil_Better_than_Peanut_Oil_Canola_Oil_Flaxseed_Oil_or_Olive_Oil" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_9" data-source="" data-orig="Is Black Sesame Oil Better than Peanut Oil">Is Black Sesame Oil Better than Peanut Oil</span>, 菜籽油, 亞麻仁油, 或橄欖油?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9" href="#Why_Do_the_Prices_of_Black_Sesame_Oil_Vary_So_Much" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_10" data-source="" data-orig="Why Do the Prices of Black Sesame Oil Vary So Much">Why Do the Prices of Black Sesame Oil Vary So Much</span>?</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_is_Black_Sesame_Oil_Made"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_11" data-source="" data-orig="How is Black Sesame Oil Made">How is Black Sesame Oil Made</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p>黑芝麻油的製作過程其實是相當複雜的. 我們來看看步驟:</p><ul><li><strong>準備食材</strong>: 黑芝麻, 核桃油 (選修的), 榨油機.</li><li><strong>將芝麻洗淨</strong>: 取適量黑芝麻, 用水清洗它們, 並瀝乾多餘的水.</li><li><strong>烤芝麻</strong>: 將瀝乾的芝麻倒入平底鍋或砂鍋中, 然後用小火烘烤它們. 用抹刀不斷攪拌，以免燒焦, 烤至芝麻爆裂，用手即可輕鬆碾碎.</li><li><strong>萃取油</strong>: 如果使用榨油機, 先預熱一下, 然後趁熱將炒好的芝麻倒入料斗中. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_12" data-source="" data-orig="The black sesame oil will flow out from the press chamber and pass through a filter into a container">The black sesame oil will flow out from the press chamber and pass through a filter into a container</span>. 如果使用食物處理機或攪拌機, 讓烤好的芝麻冷卻, 然後將它們添加到機器中. 您可以添加少量核桃油以獲得額外的光滑度並徹底混合. 混合後, 將萃取出來的黑芝麻油倒入容器中.</li><li><strong>讓油沉澱下來</strong>: 剛提煉的黑芝麻油可能會出現混濁. 讓它靜置至少 8 小時, 或如果可能的話更長, 讓油澄清.</li><li><strong>儲存</strong>: 油穩定後, 倒入密封油瓶中保存.</li></ul><p><img src="/images/sesame-oil-21-300x245.jpg" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-461" alt="black sesame oil" width="451" height="368" title="什麼是黑芝麻油ne好處以及如何使用" /></p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_to_Use_Black_Sesame_Oil"></span><strong>如何使用黑芝麻油?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p>您可能想知道黑芝麻油的使用方法是否與其他油一樣. 由於其獨特的風味, 黑芝麻油有很多用途:</p><ul><li><strong>烹飪</strong>: 它最常用於烹飪, 例如炒魚和煎魚, 增強菜餚的香氣和味道.</li><li><strong>涼菜</strong>: 可用來拌涼菜, 或拌麵, 或米飯以增加濃鬱的風味.</li><li><strong>湯類</strong>: 在湯中添加少量可以使湯更美味.</li><li><strong>沾醬</strong>: 可作為沾醬搭配各種食物.</li><li><strong>麵包和小圓麵包</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_13" data-source="" data-orig="It can also be spread on bread">It can also be spread on bread</span>, 包子, 和其他主食增添香味和營養.</li></ul><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_Are_the_Other_Uses_of_Black_Sesame_Oil"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_14" data-source="" data-orig="What Are the Other Uses of Black Sesame Oil">What Are the Other Uses of Black Sesame Oil</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p>除了搭配美味的食物, 黑芝麻油還有許多其他用途:</p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_15" data-source="" data-orig="Skincare and Moisturizing">Skincare and Moisturizing</span></strong>: 富含維生素E與不飽和脂肪酸, 它可以直接塗抹在皮膚上以保持彈性和光澤.</li><li><strong>按摩油</strong>: 質地柔滑，香氣清淡, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_16" data-source="" data-orig="it is suitable as a massage oil">it is suitable as a massage oil</span>, 促進血液循環和放鬆.</li><li><strong>頭髮護理</strong>: 將其塗在頭髮上或添加到洗髮精中有助於滋養和保護頭髮, 讓它更健康、更有光澤.</li><li><strong>膳食補充劑</strong>: 營養豐富, 含有蛋白質, 胖的, 維生素, 和礦物質, 適量食用可滋補身體、增強免疫力.</li><li><strong>草藥療法</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_17" data-source="" data-orig="According to traditional Chinese medicine">According to traditional Chinese medicine</span>, 黑芝麻油補腎, 促進消化, 並改善血液循環. 可用於藥膳以支持健康.</li></ul><p>黑芝麻油在保健方面有廣泛的用途, 美麗, 和頭髮護理.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Has_Black_Sesame_Oil_Replaced_the_Common_Oils_on_the_Market"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_18" data-source="" data-orig="Has Black Sesame Oil Replaced the Common Oils on the Market">Has Black Sesame Oil Replaced the Common Oils on the Market</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p>雖然黑芝麻油有很多用途和好處, 它尚未完全取代市場上的其他油.</p><p>黑芝麻油營養豐富，香味濃鬱, 它在烹飪中的用途有些有限. 例如, 在高溫下可能不穩定, 這可能會妨礙它發揮最佳性能. 常見的食用油如大豆油, 花生油, 和菜籽油各有各的優點, 缺點, 以及合適的烹飪方法, 補充黑芝麻油.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Will_Black_Sesame_Oil_Make_Your_Hair_Darker"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_19" data-source="" data-orig="Will Black Sesame Oil Make Your Hair Darker">Will Black Sesame Oil Make Your Hair Darker</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p>這可能是最常見的問題. 而食用黑芝麻可以在一定程度上幫助改善髮色, 這不是一個保證的效果. 黑芝麻富含蛋白質等營養素, 胖的, 維生素, 和礦物質, 包括頭髮生長必需的黑色素和微量元素, 這可能有助於頭髮健康和顏色.</p><ul><li><strong>一個. 黑芝麻中的黑色素</strong>: 黑芝麻中的黑色素可以加深頭髮的顏色, 讓它看起來更黑、更閃亮. 然而, 這個效果因人而異, 並不是每個人都會得到相同的結果.</li><li><strong>b. 鐵和鋅等微量元素</strong>: 這些元素可支持頭髮生長. 缺乏這些營養素會導致脫髮或斷裂, 補充它們可能有助於改善頭髮健康和生長.</li><li><strong>c. 黑芝麻的脂肪酸</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_20" data-source="" data-orig="These help nourish the hair">These help nourish the hair</span>, 使其更柔軟、更有光澤.</li></ul><p><img src="/images/black-sesame-oil1-300x268.jpg" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-462" alt="black sesame oil" width="537" height="480" title="什麼是黑芝麻油ne好處以及如何使用" /></p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_Much_Does_Black_Sesame_Oil_Cost"></span><strong>黑芝麻油多少錢?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p>黑芝麻油的價格因品牌等因素而異, 尺寸, 起源, 和銷售管道.</p><ul><li>小瓶黑芝麻油, 例如100ml或200ml, 可能從幾元到幾十元不等.</li><li>在批發市場, 價格可能會根據數量和品質而有所不同, 但通常比零售價更實惠.</li><li>進口或特種黑芝麻油的價格可能相對較高.</li></ul><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Which_is_Better_Black_Sesame_Oil_or_White_Sesame_Oil"></span><strong>哪個更好: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_21" data-source="" data-orig="Black Sesame Oil or White Sesame Oil">Black Sesame Oil or White Sesame Oil</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p>黑芝麻油和白芝麻油的比較取決於個人喜好和需求. 這裡有詳細的分析:</p><ul><li><strong>營養成分</strong>: 黑芝麻油蛋白質含量略高, 鈣, 和維生素E水平, 賦予它更多的健康益處.</li><li><strong>風味與口感</strong>: 白芝麻油含油量較高，氧化穩定性較好, 使其更香，非常適合烹飪和增味. 黑芝麻油香氣濃鬱深沉, 更適合健康和美容目的.</li><li><strong>用法</strong>: 黑芝麻油的煙點較高, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_22" data-source="" data-orig="making it suitable for high-temperature cooking">making it suitable for high-temperature cooking</span>. 白芝麻油, 煙點較低, 更適合低溫烹飪或作為整理油.</li><li><strong>保存期限</strong>: 白芝麻油一般具有較高的抗氧化劑含量, 賦予其更長的保質期並使其更容易儲存.</li></ul><p>綜上所述, 黑芝麻油和白芝麻油各有優點, 使它們成為健康家庭烹飪的絕佳選擇. 您可以根據自己的口味和需求來選擇.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Is_Black_Sesame_Oil_Better_than_Peanut_Oil_Canola_Oil_Flaxseed_Oil_or_Olive_Oil"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_23" data-source="" data-orig="Is Black Sesame Oil Better than Peanut Oil">Is Black Sesame Oil Better than Peanut Oil</span>, 菜籽油, 亞麻仁油, 或橄欖油?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p>到底哪種石油沒有明確的答案 &#8220;更好的,&#8221; 因為每種油都有其獨特的優點. 然而, 黑芝麻油以其卓越的健康益處而聞名, 尤其是在傳統的健康實踐中. 這是一個比較:</p><ul><li><strong>黑芝麻油</strong>: 它具有濃鬱的香氣，富含維生素E和不飽和脂肪酸. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_24" data-source="" data-orig="It offers antioxidant properties">It offers antioxidant properties</span>, 皮膚保濕, 和頭髮的好處. 更適合健康和美容目的, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_25" data-source="" data-orig="but it tends to be more expensive">but it tends to be more expensive</span>.</li><li><strong>菜籽油</strong>: 含有大量的亞麻油酸和其他不飽和脂肪酸, 以及維生素 E 和 β-胡蘿蔔素. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_26" data-source="" data-orig="It helps reduce cholesterol and prevent cardiovascular diseases">It helps reduce cholesterol and prevent cardiovascular diseases</span>, 使其適合日常烹飪. 價格適中.</li><li><strong>花生油</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_27" data-source="" data-orig="Known for its rich flavor and smooth texture">Known for its rich flavor and smooth texture</span>, 它含有油酸, 卵磷脂, 和維生素A, d, 乙, 和K. 它可以幫助降低膽固醇並保護血管, 非常適合冷菜, 清淡炒菜, 或燉菜.</li><li><strong>亞麻仁油</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_28" data-source="" data-orig="Rich in linolenic acid and alpha-linolenic acid">Rich in linolenic acid and alpha-linolenic acid</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_29" data-source="" data-orig="both essential Omega-3 fatty acids that support brain health and metabolism">both essential Omega-3 fatty acids that support brain health and metabolism</span>. 然而, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_30" data-source="" data-orig="its stability decreases with heat">its stability decreases with heat</span>, 所以最適合冷菜或低溫烹飪.</li><li><strong>橄欖油</strong>: 經常被稱為 &#8220;液體黃金,&#8221; 它包含超過 80% 不飽和脂肪酸. 它有助於降低血脂, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_31" data-source="" data-orig="prevent blood clots">prevent blood clots</span>, 並保護心血管健康. 然而, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_32" data-source="" data-orig="it is high in calories">it is high in calories</span>, 每日消費應限制在 25 克或更少. 特級初榨橄欖油不適合高溫烹飪.</li></ul><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_33" data-source="" data-orig="In choosing cooking oil">In choosing cooking oil</span>, 最好考慮你的個人品味, 烹飪方法, 營養需求, 和預算.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Why_Do_the_Prices_of_Black_Sesame_Oil_Vary_So_Much"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_34" data-source="" data-orig="Why Do the Prices of Black Sesame Oil Vary So Much">Why Do the Prices of Black Sesame Oil Vary So Much</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p>黑芝麻油價格差異較大有幾個原因:</p><ul><li><strong>生產流程</strong>: 不同品牌或製造商採用不同的生產方法, 影響油的成本和品質, 影響價格.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_35" data-source="" data-orig="Raw material quality">Raw material quality</span></strong>: 優質黑芝麻和低檔黑芝麻的成本差異很大, 而從優質種子中提取的油自然更貴.</li><li><strong>包裝尺寸</strong>: 較小的包裝通常成本較低, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_36" data-source="" data-orig="but larger packages tend to be more economical on a per-unit basis">but larger packages tend to be more economical on a per-unit basis</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_37" data-source="" data-orig="Brand reputation">Brand reputation</span></strong>: 知名品牌或信譽良好的知名公司由於其積極的客戶回饋和可靠性，通常會收取較高的價格.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_38" data-source="" data-orig="Market supply and demand">Market supply and demand</span></strong>: 市場狀況也會影響定價. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_39" data-source="" data-orig="When supply exceeds demand">When supply exceeds demand</span>, 價格下降; 當需求高於供應時, 價格上漲.</li></ul><p>綜上所述, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_40" data-source="" data-orig="the price difference of black sesame oil is a result of various factors combined">the price difference of black sesame oil is a result of various factors combined</span>.</p>`} />
  </article>
